#. module: pos_self_order_mobile
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_mobile
msgid ""
"\n"
"This module provides the POS Self Order function of the Odoo Mobile App.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ໂມດູນນີ້ສະໜອງຟັງຊັນການສັ່ງຊື້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຂອງ POS ໃນແອັບ Odoo Mobile.\n"

#. module: pos_self_order_mobile
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_self_order_mobile/static/src/backend/open_kiosk.js:0
