msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດ kiosk ໃນອຸປະກອນນີ້ໄດ້"

#. module: pos_self_order_mobile
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_self_order_mobile.field_pos_config__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

#. module: pos_self_order_mobile
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_self_order_mobile/static/src/backend/open_kiosk.js:0
