msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Kiosk"

#. module: pos_self_order_mobile
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_self_order_mobile/static/src/backend/open_kiosk.js:0
msgid ""
"This device will open in fullscreen kiosk mode.\n"
"Choose “Open Normally” to continue without kiosk restrictions."
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນນີ້ຈະເປີດໃນໂໝດ kiosk ແບບເຕັມຈໍ.\n"
"ເລືອກ “ເປີດແບບປົກກະຕິ” ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ kiosk."
